  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "钻时是「每钻进一米花了多少分钟」。泥岩致密难钻、砂岩疏松好钻，所以钻时曲线会随岩性变化——但它同时也随钻压、转速、排量变化，这是它不能单独使用的原因。地层划分的目标不是「把曲线切成几段」，而是「找出那些真的由地层造成的跳变」，并且宁可多给候选，也不漏掉真界面。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "序列分割 / 变点检测", "desc": "找界面，不是逐点分类" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "30—50 口井", "desc": "人工划分界面作标签" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "界面候选", "desc": "少一次「回头重划」" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "中", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span>", "desc": "单曲线信息少，必须多源交叉" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>钻时曲线是录井里最「便宜」的一条曲线：不需要额外仪器，钻进过程自然产生。它反映岩石的<b>可钻性</b>——越难钻，钻时越大。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 252' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻时曲线与岩性柱'><rect width='620' height='252' fill='#ffffff'/><line x1='60' y1='26' x2='60' y2='200' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='60' y1='200' x2='240' y2='200' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><text x='60' y='18' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>钻时（min/m）→</text><text x='46' y='30' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>3200</text><text x='46' y='200' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>3400</text><text x='10' y='118' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>井深 m</text><polyline points='200.4,26 204,34.7 196.8,43.4 202.2,52.1 198.6,60.8 201,64.3 117.6,66.9 114,78.2 120,86.9 112.8,95.6 115.2,102.6 200.4,105.2 196.8,116.5 202.2,127 198.6,130.4 150,133 154,144.3 148,156.5 152,165.2 105,167.8 100,179 106,189.5 102,200' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><rect x='300' y='26' width='44' height='38.3' fill='#6b89a3' fill-opacity='.55' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='300' y='64.3' width='44' height='38.3' fill='#c99a56' fill-opacity='.55' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='300' y='102.6' width='44' height='27.9' fill='#6b89a3' fill-opacity='.55' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='300' y='130.5' width='44' height='34.8' fill='#a3855f' fill-opacity='.55' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='300' y='165.3' width='44' height='34.7' fill='#c99a56' fill-opacity='.55' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='352' y='48' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>泥岩</text><text x='352' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>砂岩</text><text x='352' y='119' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>泥岩</text><text x='352' y='151' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>粉砂岩</text><text x='352' y='186' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>砂岩</text><line x1='60' y1='64.3' x2='300' y2='64.3' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.5'/><line x1='60' y1='102.6' x2='300' y2='102.6' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.5'/><line x1='60' y1='130.5' x2='300' y2='130.5' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.5'/><line x1='60' y1='165.3' x2='300' y2='165.3' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.5'/><text x='300' y='18' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>岩性</text><text x='352' y='216' font-size='8' fill='#235f51' font-weight='600'>界面就是层段边界</text><text x='60' y='234' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>左边是钻时曲线，右边是岩性柱。两者形状确实对应：泥岩段钻时高，砂岩段钻时低</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　形状确实对应，<b>但注意泥岩段曲线内部的锯齿</b>——那不是岩性变化，是钻压与转速的小幅调整。人眼分不清这两类起伏，这就是这个任务的本质困难。</p><p>更麻烦的是钻时会被操作参数整体带偏。下面这个台阶最能说明问题：</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 150' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='不加归一化会把钻压变化当成地层界面'><rect width='620' height='150' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='0' y='18' width='296' height='118' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='14' y='34' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 原始钻时</text><line x1='14' y1='104' x2='282' y2='104' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='14,88 36,90 58,86 80,89 102,87 124,88 146,90 168,87 190,72 212,58 234,56 256,58 278,57' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><line x1='190' y1='44' x2='190' y2='104' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><text x='196' y='52' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51' font-weight='600'>台阶 = 假界面</text><text x='14' y='124' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>看起来像「进入砂岩」，其实是司钻提了钻压</text><rect x='312' y='18' width='308' height='118' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='326' y='34' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 归一化后</text><line x1='326' y1='104' x2='606' y2='104' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='326,88 348,90 370,86 392,89 414,87 436,88 458,90 480,87 502,88 524,86 546,89 568,87 590,88' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='326' y='124' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>台阶消失，只剩地层信号</text><text x='0' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>归一化不是为了好看，是为了让变点对应地层，而不是对应操作痕迹</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左边那个台阶是<b>钻压提高</b>造成的，与地层无关。<b>不做归一化，变点检测只会忠实地找出操作痕迹</b>——而且它会给出很高的置信度，因为信号确实在那里跳了。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把钻时归一化到统一工况后，用变点检测找界面，再和岩屑、气测、测井交叉验证。<b>输出的是「候选界面」，不是「最终分层」</b>——这个定位决定了项目能不能落地。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻时地层划分的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · FIX</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>迟到校正</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>归位到井深</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>按排量重算</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · NORM</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>工况归一化</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>扣钻压 / 转速</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>折算到基准</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · CPD</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>变点检测</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>最优分段</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>惩罚项控层数</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · CROSS</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>多源交叉</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>岩屑 / 气测</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>测井 GR</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · OUT</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>候选界面</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>深度 + 置信度</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>人工增删</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>第 2 步决定上限：归一化没做好，变点检测只是在找操作痕迹</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第 2 步是上限所在。<b>归一化的验收方式很直观</b>：同一层段在不同井、不同钻压下，归一化后的钻时应该接近。做不到这一条，第 3 步做得再漂亮也没意义。</p><p>第 3 步有一个反直觉的要点：<b>界面永远落在「均值跳变」处，不在极值点</b>。用「找峰」的思路做分层，会系统性地把界面往后拖半米。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>门槛不高，但有一个硬要求：<b>必须同时有钻时和钻井参数</b>，否则无法归一化。这一条经常被忽略，而它决定了整个方案可不可行。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻时相关数据的采样频次'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>SAMPLING · 钻时与它的归一化依据</text><line x1='106' y1='22' x2='106' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='106' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1s</text><line x1='222' y1='22' x2='222' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='222' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1m</text><line x1='339' y1='22' x2='339' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='339' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1h</text><line x1='429' y1='22' x2='429' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='429' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1d</text><line x1='526' y1='22' x2='526' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='526' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>30d</text><text x='98' y='38' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>钻压 / 转速</text><line x1='106' y1='34' x2='141' y2='34' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='106' cy='34' r='2.4' fill='#41699b'/><text x='534' y='38' font-size='8' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' font-weight='600'>1—5 s（必需）</text><text x='98' y='62' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>钻时</text><line x1='268' y1='58' x2='288' y2='58' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='268' cy='58' r='2.4' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='534' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>0.5—1 m</text><text x='98' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>岩屑 / 气测</text><line x1='224' y1='82' x2='250' y2='82' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='224' cy='82' r='2.4' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='534' y='86' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>按米</text><text x='98' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>测井 GR</text><circle cx='429' cy='106' r='3' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='534' y='110' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>单井一次</text><text x='98' y='134' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>分层表</text><circle cx='339' cy='130' r='3' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='534' y='134' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>人工划分</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第一行标了「必需」，因为它是<b>归一化的唯一依据</b>。只有钻时没有钻压，等于只能用原始曲线猜——而原始曲线的台阶与地层台阶在形态上无法区分。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>钻时曲线</b>：0.5—1 m 一点，人工划分界面 30—50 口井，作为标签<br>· <b>钻井参数</b>：钻压、转速、排量，1—5 s 采样，用于归一化<br>· <b>岩屑与气测</b>：同井段资料，用于交叉验证<br>· <b>测井曲线</b>：GR 等，作为独立参照</p><p><b>最容易被忽略的一条</b>　「迟到时间已校正」。这一条看起来是数据处理的细节，其实<b>决定了钻时与岩屑是否在同一个深度上</b>——不在同一个深度，交叉验证就是拿两个不同深度的东西互相印证。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>方法成熟，难点在归一化与界面口径。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>钻时天然产生</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>归一化难度</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>需钻压 / 转速同步</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>标签一致性</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>界面口径不一</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>信息量</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>单曲线信息有限</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>唯一 3 格是「信息量」→ 所以它适合做辅助，不适合做替代</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text><text x='418' y='118' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>定位建议</text><text x='418' y='133' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>不要做「自动分层」</text><text x='418' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>要做「候选界面提示」</text><text x='418' y='159' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>前者的验收是 100%</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　唯一 3 格是「信息量」：<b>单靠钻时永远不够，必须多源</b>。这也是它适合做「辅助」而不是「替代」的原因——不是模型不行，是这条曲线本身携带的信息就那么多。</p><p><b>定位建议</b>　这是本案例最重要的一句话：<b>不要做「自动分层」，做「候选界面提示」</b>。前者要求 100% 正确，后者只需要「不漏」。前者永远验收不过，后者每口井都能用上。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　变点检测 · 多源融合 · 迟到时间校正 · 序列分割</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>这个案例是「<b>目标定得对，比模型选得好更重要</b>」的典型：从「自动分层」退成「候选提示」，项目立刻就能落地，因为验收口径从「100% 正确」变成了「不漏且可复核」。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 230' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='230' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>归一化 + 最优分段</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>三件东西，各有分工：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① 迟到校正（规则）</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 工况归一（回归）</text><text x='18' y='100' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>③ 带惩罚的最优分段</text><rect x='18' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='47' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='47' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>归位</text><rect x='82' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='111' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='111' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>折算</text><rect x='146' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='175' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='175' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>分段</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>①② 里没有可训练参数，但它们</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>决定了 ③ 找到的东西是不是地层。</text><text x='18' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>顺序不能换，也不该合并。</text><text x='18' y='222' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>「先归一再分段」是硬约束</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>界面被三种东西污染</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>钻压、转速、排量——这三样都能</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>在曲线上造出与地层跳变同形的台阶。</text><text x='224' y='96' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>不归一化</text><rect x='232' y='87' width='118' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='358' y='96' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>46%</text><text x='224' y='122' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>归一化后</text><rect x='232' y='113' width='150' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='390' y='122' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>92%</text><text x='224' y='150' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>界面精确率差一倍。而且不归一化</text><text x='224' y='164' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>的那个版本，在训练集上看起来</text><text x='224' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>更好——它完美拟合了操作习惯。</text><text x='224' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>这一点最伤人：错的方式在本地指标上</text><text x='224' y='217' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>总是更好看。</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>做「提示」，不做「决定」</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>一个惩罚项同时控两件事：</text><rect x='430' y='68' width='172' height='30' rx='5' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='81' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>β 太小 → 噪声变界面</text><text x='440' y='93' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>层数虚高，解释员要一条条删</text><rect x='430' y='102' width='172' height='30' rx='5' fill='#f9efd7' stroke='#a97a1c' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='115' font-size='8.2' fill='#7d5a12' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>β 太大 → 薄层被合并</text><text x='440' y='127' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12'>漏一层就是漏一个目的层</text><text x='430' y='150' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>所以取「召回优先」的那一侧：</text><rect x='430' y='158' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 164 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='168' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>宁可多给，不可漏给</text><rect x='430' y='178' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 184 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='188' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>解释员只做删减，不做补充</text><text x='430' y='212' font-size='7.8' fill='#242b2e'>删比补快得多——这是交互设计的选择。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左：用了什么。中：为什么非它不可，以及「错的方式指标更好看」这个陷阱。右：它凭什么有用——<b>最后那条「删比补快」不是算法，是产品决策</b>，但它决定了这个功能会不会被用。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一个区块的钻时界面提示",
      "lead": [
        "目标不是「自动分层」，而是**把候选界面推给解释员，漏检率低于 5%**。",
        "这个目标刻意降低了：宁可多给候选，也不能漏掉真界面——因为删掉一个错的只要两秒，补上一个漏的要翻三张表。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["井数", "36"],
        ["界面", "8 个标志层"],
        ["漏检率", "<5%"],
        ["候选/井", "约 14 个"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "迟到时间校正",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "把钻时按迟到时间归位到真实井深，排量变化时逐段重算，而不是全井用一个值。",
          "effect": "让钻时与岩屑对齐",
          "trap": "固定迟到时间，排量一变就整体错位——**而错位之后，界面会系统性地偏上或偏下，看起来却「很规律」**"
        },
        {
          "name": "参数归一化",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "用钻压、转速、排量把钻时折算到统一基准工况，得到「可钻性指标」。",
          "effect": "把操作变化从曲线里去掉",
          "trap": "不归一化，模型会学成「钻压越高地层越砂岩」——**而且这个错误在单井验证里看不出来**"
        },
        {
          "name": "变点检测",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "用最优分段（带惩罚项）找候选界面，惩罚项控制层数，输出深度与置信度。",
          "effect": "把曲线切成层段",
          "trap": "惩罚太大薄层被合并；太小噪声变界面——**而这两个方向的代价完全不同，要选召回那一侧**"
        },
        {
          "name": "多源交叉验证",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "把候选界面与岩屑描述、气测异常、GR 曲线比对，剔除孤立界面。",
          "effect": "把「数学界面」变成「地质界面」",
          "trap": "只用钻时，孤立噪声会被当成层——**四条证据至少满足两条，这条规则能砍掉大部分误报**"
        },
        {
          "name": "界面输出与回写",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "输出候选界面与置信度，解释员增删改后回写训练集，修改理由可选填。",
          "effect": "每口井都在改进下一口",
          "trap": "没有回写，模型会一直重复同样的错——**而解释员会以为「这系统本来就这样」**"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点：每一步产出什么、验收什么",
        "html": "<p>下面五张图对应上面五步。<b>第 1 步与第 4 步不含任何模型，但它们分别决定「界面在不在正确深度」和「数学界面能不能变成地质界面」</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第一步 迟到时间校正'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 01 · 迟到校正 · 固定值会在排量变化处整体错位</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='296' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 固定迟到时间</text><line x1='12' y1='80' x2='284' y2='80' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='12,74 36,72 60,76 84,72 108,75 132,70 156,72 180,68 204,70 228,66 252,68 276,64' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><rect x='140' y='22' width='58' height='58' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.1'/><text x='169' y='98' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>排量变化</text><text x='12' y='110' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51'>曲线整体偏移约 2 m</text><rect x='312' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='324' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 逐段重算</text><line x1='324' y1='80' x2='606' y2='80' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='324,74 348,72 372,76 396,72 420,75 444,70 470,74 498,72 522,76 548,72 572,75 598,71' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='324' y='110' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51'>界面落在同一深度</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='0'>.</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第二步 参数归一化'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 02 · 归一化 · 验收方式是「跨井可比」</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='196' height='84' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A 井 · 轻钻压</text><polyline points='12,88 32,62 52,66 72,44 92,48 112,58 132,40 152,62 172,58' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='12' y='102' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9'>同一层段</text><rect x='212' y='22' width='196' height='84' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B 井 · 重钻压</text><polyline points='224,80 244,50 264,54 284,32 304,36 324,46 344,28 364,50 384,46' fill='none' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='224' y='102' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51'>同层段但整体偏低</text><rect x='424' y='22' width='196' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='436' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>归一化后</text><polyline points='436,70 456,52 476,56 496,40 516,44 536,54 556,38 576,52 596,50' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><polyline points='436,72 456,54 476,58 496,42 516,46 536,56 556,40 576,54 596,52' fill='none' stroke='#235f51' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='3 2' stroke-opacity='.7'/><text x='436' y='102' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51'>两条曲线基本重合 → 验收通过</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第三步 变点检测与惩罚项'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 03 · 变点检测 · 界面在均值跳变处，不在极值点</text><line x1='20' y1='92' x2='600' y2='92' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='20,56 50,54 80,58 110,55 140,57 170,54 200,56 230,53 260,55 290,52 320,84 350,86 380,83 410,85 440,82 470,84 500,81 530,83 560,82 590,84' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><line x1='305' y1='24' x2='305' y2='92' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='305' cy='52' r='3' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='305' y='20' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>界面</text><circle cx='290' cy='52' r='2.6' fill='#b05a51'/><text x='284' y='44' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='end'>极值点</text><text x='20' y='110' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>用「找峰」思路做分层，界面会系统性偏后半米——因为极值点总在跳变之后</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第四步 多源交叉验证'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 04 · 多源交叉 · 四条至少满足两条</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='150' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>候选界面</text><text x='12' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>深度 3286.5 m</text><text x='12' y='74' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>置信度 0.82</text><text x='12' y='94' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>来自第 3 步</text><path d='M158 64h24' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.3'/><path d='M182 64l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='194' y='22' width='200' height='84' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='206' y='32' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M209 38 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='226' y='42' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>岩屑描述有变化</text><rect x='206' y='50' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M209 56 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='226' y='60' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>GR 有台阶</text><rect x='206' y='68' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#f5f2ea' stroke='#c9c2b0'/><text x='226' y='78' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>气测无响应</text><rect x='206' y='86' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#f5f2ea' stroke='#c9c2b0'/><text x='226' y='96' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>层序与区域方案缺</text><rect x='410' y='22' width='210' height='84' rx='7' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='422' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>判定：采纳</text><text x='422' y='60' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>满足 2 / 4 → 进入候选</text><text x='422' y='78' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>标注「需人工确认」</text><text x='422' y='98' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>只满足 1 条的要单独列</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第五步 输出与回写'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 05 · 输出回写 · 删掉的那个界面最值钱</text><rect x='0' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='12' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>候选界面</text><rect x='160' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='172' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='172' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>人工增删</text><rect x='320' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#e7eef9' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='332' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='332' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>理由可选填</text><rect x='480' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#f1f1dd' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='492' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04</text><text x='492' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>回流训练</text><path d='M136 48h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M156 48l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M296 48h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M316 48l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M456 48h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M476 48l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><text x='0' y='92' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>解释员删掉的那个界面，说明模型把什么当成了地层——<b>这是最值钱的负样本</b></text><text x='0' y='108' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：每条界面都能追溯到「谁、什么时候、采纳还是删了、为什么」</text></svg><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算「提示得好」</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>界面召回</td><td>真界面中被提示到的比例</td><td>0.96</td></tr><tr><td>界面精确率</td><td>提示的界面中真实的比例</td><td>0.68</td></tr><tr><td>平均偏差</td><td>命中界面的深度误差均值</td><td>0.42 m</td></tr><tr><td>每井候选数</td><td>平均提示的界面个数</td><td>14</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>按「界面是否落在容差内」评价，不用逐点准确率。注意<b>精确率 0.68 不是缺点，是设计选择</b>——用 32% 的多余候选换来 96% 的召回，解释员只做删减。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        { "name": "假界面来自操作变化", "why": "钻压、转速调整在曲线上与地层变化同形。解决方向：先归一化再检测，并把钻压突变点作为「不可信区间」标出。" },
        { "name": "薄层被惩罚项合并", "why": "最小层厚设得太大，几十厘米的层直接消失。解决方向：分层建模，先粗后细；或对薄层单独放宽惩罚。" },
        { "name": "迟到时间错位", "why": "排量变化后迟到时间改变，界面整体偏移。解决方向：按排量逐段重算，并用岩屑描述反查对齐情况。" }
      ]
    },

    "demo": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "html": "demo/index.html",
      "label": "可运行示范",
      "intro": "关闭「工况归一化」，曲线中段会多出一个台阶——那不是地层，是司钻提了钻压。看变点检测怎么忠实地把它当成界面。再拖「惩罚 β」：往左薄层浮出来，往右薄层被合并。",
      "height": 640
    }
  }
}
